<section class="policy-hero"><div class="policy-wrap"><h1>Volunteer with the Lions</h1><p>It takes more than players to build a rugby club.</p></div></section>
<section class="volunteer" id="volunteers">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="section-body">Livermore Lions is a community-run youth rugby club. You don't need years of rugby experience to help — some roles need rugby knowledge, plenty don't.</p>
<div class="vol-grid">
<div class="vol-card"><h3>Coach</h3><p>Help teach the game, alongside experienced coaches.</p></div>
<div class="vol-card"><h3>Team Parent</h3><p>Help with communications, snacks and match-day logistics.</p></div>
<div class="vol-card"><h3>Referee</h3><p>Help officiate flag and youth rugby games.</p></div>
<div class="vol-card"><h3>Medic / First Aid</h3><p>Support player welfare at training and match days.</p></div>
<div class="vol-card"><h3>Match Day Help</h3><p>Fields, equipment, flags, tents and setup.</p></div>
<div class="vol-card"><h3>Club Administration</h3><p>Help with registration, sponsorship or fundraising.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="vol-cta-row">
<p>Ready to help build the club?<span>Email us and tell us where you'd like to help.</span></p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.volunteerEmail }}" style="background:#fff;color:var(--charcoal);">Join the Pride</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
